COSMolith Voulage packaging model
=================================

The source model pins COSMolith to commit 296d576b8fabaf23535980975cf825337010e4e5.
Cargo.lock and .cargo/config.toml are reviewable inputs. The generated vendor/
directory and vendor.tar remain local build evidence because GitHub rejects the
1.02 GB archive. Recreate them offline when the required Cargo cache is present:

  rm -rf vendor
  cargo vendor --locked --versioned-dirs > .cargo/config.toml
  tar pcf vendor.tar vendor

The binary build then uses `CARGO_NET_OFFLINE=true cargo build --release
--locked --offline`.
